    "created_at": "2020-05-14T16:53:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-05-14T16:53:37Z",
    "body": "caption is a IDL attribute/property of table elements. textContent is a IDL attribute/property of a superclass (if you see InterfaceName : SuperInterfaceName in IDL that means InterfaceName is a subclass).",
